Out of 377,705 citizens living abroad eligible to vote, 88,728 (23.5%) eventually did so, predominantly in [[Bosnia and Herzegovina]] (48 thousand out of 140,742 eligible to vote) and Germany (23 thousand). In total, 81,107 (91.4%) voted for Tudman, 2,676 for Tomac, and 4,463 for Gotovac.<ref>{{cite web |title=Rezultati Glasovanja u Inozemstvu za Izbor Predsjedinka Republike Iirvatske |url=https://www.izbori.hr/arhiva-izbora/data/predsjednik/1997/rezultati/1997_4_3_Rezultati_Predsjednik_inozemstvo.pdf |website=izbori.hr |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20211213170449/https://www.izbori.hr/arhiva-izbora/data/predsjednik/1997/rezultati/1997_4_3_Rezultati_Predsjednik_inozemstvo.pdf |archive-date=2021-12-13 |url-status=live}}</ref>

Voter turnout was fairly low in [[Eastern Slavonia, Baranja and Western Syrmia (1995–1998)|Eastern Slavonia]], then under UN administration and with an ethnic Serb majority.<ref>{{Cite news|url=https://groups.google.com/forum/#!searchin/bit.listserv.hrvatska/1997&#124;sort:date/bit.listserv.hrvatska/opW55yse0zw/oY97g1nxm30J|title=NEPOSTOVANJE HRVATSKE DRZAVNOSTI|last=Levak|first=Nevenka|date=1997-06-17|work=GLAS SLAVONIJE|page=14}}</ref> UNTAES complained that Croatian authorities did not update voting records in time, which left some 10% of those who did turn out to cast a ballot without a vote.<ref>S.Canic: UNTAES O IZBORIMA, ''Vjesnik'', 18.06.1997</ref> Voter turnout was also low in some opposition-friendly regions; for instance, in [[Krapina-Zagorje County|Krapina-Zagorje county]] it stood around 40%.<ref>{{Cite news|url=https://groups.google.com/forum/#!searchin/bit.listserv.hrvatska/1997&#124;sort:date/bit.listserv.hrvatska/bBMPmKzltnc/wth7h76UCD8J|title=Vlast i slast|last=Radja|first=Tihomil|date=3 July 1997|work=VIJENAC|issue=91}}</ref> Turnout was highest in Pozega-Slavonia County (51,38%), while Zadar county reported lowest figures - just 34,5%.<ref>Sandra Bartolovic (16.06.1997.) [https://groups.google.com/forum/#!searchin/bit.listserv.hrvatska/1997|sort:date/bit.listserv.hrvatska/G12im12PwEw/t4V-JF68d0AJ TUDMANOVA UVJERLJIVA POBJEDA VEC U PRVOM KRUGU PREDSJEDNICKIH IZBORA], Vjesnik</ref>

